{
  "name": "Qualify Typeform Leads with WhatsApp Polls, HubSpot CRM and Slack via Supergreen",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "d7070007-7777-4777-8777-000000000001",
      "name": "Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -608,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Qualify Typeform leads instantly with WhatsApp polls, HubSpot CRM and Slack\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Captures new Typeform lead submissions in real time, deduplicates webhook retries, and upserts the contact in HubSpot CRM.\n2. Immediately sends a native 3-option WhatsApp qualification poll via Supergreen (no Meta template approvals or per-message fees) and stores the `pollMessageId` in Google Sheets.\n3. Listens for live poll votes to automatically promote urgent buyers to Sales Qualified Lead in HubSpot, reply with a fast-track booking link on WhatsApp, and alert your sales team in Slack.\n4. Routes 30-day buyers and early researchers to tailored WhatsApp follow-ups and HubSpot lifecycle stages without noisy sales pings.\n5. Runs a daily 09:00 sweep to send one polite 24-hour WhatsApp follow-up to leads who have not voted yet, and posts workflow errors to Slack.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the `n8n-nodes-supergreen` community node and connect your WhatsApp number at [supergreen.cc/n8n](https://supergreen.cc/n8n?utm_source=n8n&utm_medium=template&utm_campaign=typeform-hubspot-whatsapp-polls).\n- [ ] Connect credentials for **Typeform OAuth2**, **HubSpot App Token**, **Supergreen API**, **Google Sheets OAuth2**, and **Slack OAuth2**.\n- [ ] Select your Typeform lead form containing Email, Phone / WhatsApp, Name, and optional Company / Need fields.\n- [ ] Create a Google Sheet with a `Leads` tab containing columns: `leadId`, `email`, `fullName`, `companyName`, `phone`, `useCase`, `pollMessageId`, `qualification`, `nudgeDueAt`, `nudgeSent`, `updatedAt`.\n- [ ] Replace `SET_TYPEFORM_FORM_ID`, `SET_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID`, `SET_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID`, your brand name, `bookingUrl`, and `guideUrl` in the configuration and error nodes.\n\n### Customization\n\nEdit the 3 poll choices to qualify by budget or team size instead of timeline, adjust `nudgeHours` (default 24), or swap Typeform for Tally, Jotform, or Webflow forms.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 960
      }
    },
